<aside class="reg-note fee-foot" id="class-billing" style="padding:20px;border:1px solid #dce6e1;border-radius:10px;margin:24px 0"><strong>How we count classes</strong><p>Our fees for subsequent trademark services, including renewal, changes, assignment and transfer, are charged per trademark, per class. A single application or registration number covering multiple classes is charged separately for each class being handled. For example, a three-class registration counts as three class units, not one.</p><p>We normally file new applications one class at a time, with a separate application number for each class. Registration fees include up to 10 goods or services per class; additional items cost USD 10 each. Subsequent services are based on class count, not the number of goods or services. The portal order or agreed written quotation confirms the scope and total.</p></aside>
